    <item>
      <title>QingWen</title>
      <link>//localhost:1313/post/qingwen/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
      <author>2388468249@qq.com (Phoenix)</author>
      <guid>//localhost:1313/post/qingwen/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>QingWen</h1><p>作者：Phoenix（2388468249@qq.com）</p>
        
          <h2 id="qingwen10">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#qingwen10"></a>
QingWen1.0
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-gdscript3" data-lang="gdscript3"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 启动后端</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">conda</span> <span class="n">activate</span> <span class="n">agent</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">cd</span> <span class="n">D</span><span class="p">:</span>\<span class="n">pycharm</span>\<span class="n">PythonProject2</span>\<span class="n">QIngWen</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">uvicorn</span> <span class="n">server</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="n">app</span> <span class="o">--</span><span class="n">reload</span> <span class="o">--</span><span class="n">port</span> <span class="mi">8000</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># Python静态服务器</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">conda</span> <span class="n">activate</span> <span class="n">agent</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">cd</span> <span class="n">D</span><span class="p">:</span>\<span class="n">pycharm</span>\<span class="n">PythonProject2</span>\<span class="n">QIngWen</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">python</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">m</span> <span class="n">http</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">server</span> <span class="mi">5500</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="回答的还是很搞笑的需要在做一下迭代">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%9b%9e%e7%ad%94%e7%9a%84%e8%bf%98%e6%98%af%e5%be%88%e6%90%9e%e7%ac%91%e7%9a%84%e9%9c%80%e8%a6%81%e5%9c%a8%e5%81%9a%e4%b8%80%e4%b8%8b%e8%bf%ad%e4%bb%a3"></a>
回答的还是很搞笑的需要在做一下迭代
</h2><h2 id="qingwen启动与测试">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#qingwen%e5%90%af%e5%8a%a8%e4%b8%8e%e6%b5%8b%e8%af%95"></a>
QingWen启动与测试
</h2><h3 id="启动">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%90%af%e5%8a%a8"></a>
启动
</h3><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1">#切换环境</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">conda activate agent
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1">#启动服务</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">uvicorn server:app --reload --port <span class="m">8000</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1">#进入</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">redis-cli
</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id="测试感觉有点懵需要恶补fastapi了">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e6%b5%8b%e8%af%95%e6%84%9f%e8%a7%89%e6%9c%89%e7%82%b9%e6%87%b5%e9%9c%80%e8%a6%81%e6%81%b6%e8%a1%a5fastapi%e4%ba%86"></a>
测试（感觉有点懵需要恶补FastAPI了）
</h3><blockquote>
<p>post /chat -&gt; Try it out  -&gt; Request body {&ldquo;message&rdquo;: &ldquo;我想减肥&rdquo;} -&gt; Execute -&gt; 下方 Response body 复制返回的 session_id
-&gt; Request body {&ldquo;session_id&rdquo;: &ldquo;刚才复制的那串&rdquo;,&ldquo;message&rdquo;: &ldquo;172，68公斤，28岁，男的&rdquo;} -&gt; Execute -&gt; Request body
{&ldquo;session_id&rdquo;: &ldquo;同一串&rdquo;,&ldquo;message&rdquo;: &ldquo;一周练3天，不吃辣&rdquo;} -&gt; 下方 Response body stage 变成 &ldquo;done&rdquo;</p>
        
        <hr><p>本文2026-09-20首发于<a href='//localhost:1313/'>Phoenix</a>，最后修改于2026-09-20</p>]]>
      </description>
      
