        <![CDATA[<h1>Agent 经典范式</h1><p>作者：Phoenix（2388468249@qq.com）</p>
        
          <h2 id="react">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#react"></a>
ReAct
</h2><p>思考行动，边想边做，动态调整</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Thought -&gt; Action -&gt; Observation</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="plan-and-solve">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#plan-and-solve"></a>
Plan-and Solve
</h2><p>三思而后行，Agent先生成完整行动计划，然后严格执行</p>
<h2 id="reflection">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#reflection"></a>
Reflection
</h2><p>可以反思，进行自我批评、修正</p>
        
